This covers src/incident2chaos/data/corpus.csv, src/incident2chaos/data/blind_sample.csv,
src/incident2chaos/data/fault_classes.json, src/incident2chaos/data/triggers.json,
data/codebook.md and data/site_terms.md.

Attribution: Yogesh Ramaswamy, incident2chaos corpus and codebook for paper 1, 2026.

The reports themselves belong to their publishers and are not included. The corpus holds
only each report's link, its title and date as the publisher's index lists them, and
labels and short evidence notes written by the author.
